      "aboutPageTitle": "About — NaMe Magazine",
      "aboutPageDescription": "About NaMe Magazine — a platform for artists before the world knows their names",
      "aboutLabel": "About",
      "aboutTitle": "Before the Name",
      "aboutBody": "<p class=\"static-page__lead\">NaMe Magazine is a platform for artists before the world knows their names. Rooted in the theme &ldquo;Before the Name,&rdquo; the magazine exists to support photographers, designers, filmmakers, writers, and visual artists whose voices are still forming outside of mainstream visibility.</p><h2>Why NaMe exists</h2><p>We believe that before recognition, awards, or industry validation, there is first the desire to create and to be seen. NaMe Magazine was created to hold space for that moment&mdash;the period before an artist becomes a &ldquo;name,&rdquo; yet is already making meaningful work.</p><h2>What we build</h2><p>Through open calls, features, editorials, interviews, and online discussion, NaMe Magazine aims to build a growing archive and community centered around new creative voices from different mediums and backgrounds.</p><p><strong>All mediums are welcome.</strong></p><p>Before the world knows your name, there is only the desire to be seen.</p><p>Want to share your work? Visit <a href=\"/submission.html\">Submission</a> or <a href=\"/community.html\">Community</a>.</p>",
      "businessPageTitle": "Business — NaMe Magazine",
      "businessPageDescription": "Partnerships and advertising with NaMe Magazine",
      "businessLabel": "Business",
      "businessTitle": "Partnerships & Advertising",
      "businessBody": "<p class=\"static-page__lead\">NaMe partners with fashion, beauty, and lifestyle brands that align with our editorial voice.</p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul><li>Sponsored editorials &amp; branded films</li><li>Newsletter &amp; social integrations</li><li>Event coverage &amp; activations</li><li>Custom content for campaigns</li></ul><h2>Contact</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:namemagazinenyc@gmail.com\">namemagazinenyc@gmail.com</a> with your brand, timeline, and objectives. We respond within 3–5 business days.</p>",
